{
 "file": "23SOH01B base 0x5000",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:26",
   "ptr": "0x26",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "「よく来た・・・\\n",
   "en": "\"Welcome... I have known of you two for some time.",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:3b",
   "ptr": "0x3b",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　おぬしたちのことは、以前から知って\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:26"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:64",
   "ptr": "0x64",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "　おった。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:26"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:82",
   "ptr": "0x82",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　入江の村で、ゲーツという漁師に会っ\\n",
   "en": "You met a fisherman called Goetz in the Cove Village, did you not? He was of this village to begin with.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:ab",
   "ptr": "0xab",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "　ただろう？\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:82"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:bc",
   "ptr": "0xbc",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　あの者は、もともと、この村の者じゃ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　ただろう？\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:82"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:f4",
   "ptr": "0xf4",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　入江の村で、ゲーツという漁師に会っ\\n",
   "en": "You met a fisherman called Goetz in the Cove Village, did you not?",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:11d",
   "ptr": "0x11d",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "　ただろう？\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:f4"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:12f",
   "ptr": "0x12f",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "　なに？　会ってない？\\n",
   "en": "What? You didn't? I see, hmm... Well, be that as it may.",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:14a",
   "ptr": "0x14a",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "　そうか、う～む・・・\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　なに？　会ってない？\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:12f"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:165",
   "ptr": "0x165",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "　ま、それはともかく。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　そうか、う～む・・・\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:12f"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:18a",
   "ptr": "0x18a",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　・・・このクライツェンの地には、\\n",
   "en": "...This land of Kreutzen is steeped in the Wave, which little by little twists all things strangely.",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:1b1",
   "ptr": "0x1b1",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　全ての物を少しづつ、奇妙に変えて\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:18a"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:1d8",
   "ptr": "0x1d8",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "　しまう波動が満ちておる。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:18a"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:1f8",
   "ptr": "0x1f8",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　鉄は黒い鉱石へ、生物は魔物へ、\\n",
   "en": "Iron into Black Ore, living things into monsters, and humans into...",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:21d",
   "ptr": "0x21d",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "　そして人間は・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:1f8"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:237",
   "ptr": "0x237",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　それが何者の仕業か、もう、わかって\\n",
   "en": "By now you know whose doing it is, I'd wager. ...Yes, it is the Black Dragon.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:260",
   "ptr": "0x260",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "　おろう。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:237"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:26f",
   "ptr": "0x26f",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　・・・そうじゃ、《黒竜》じゃよ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　おろう。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:237"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:297",
   "ptr": "0x297",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　秩序あるものを混沌に変え、そして\\n",
   "en": "It turns all that has order into chaos, and in the end, into meaningless rubbish.",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:2be",
   "ptr": "0x2be",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　最後には意味の無いゴミくずにして\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:297"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:2e5",
   "ptr": "0x2e5",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "　しまう。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:297"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:2f5",
   "ptr": "0x2f5",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　それこそが、地の底に眠る《黒竜》の\\n",
   "en": "That is the power of the Black Dragon that sleeps beneath the earth.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:31e",
   "ptr": "0x31e",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "　力なのじゃ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:2f5"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:332",
   "ptr": "0x332",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　古えより、この地に住まう我らは、\\n",
   "en": "We who have dwelt here since days of old were changed in body, nearer to monsters than men...",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:359",
   "ptr": "0x359",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　人と言うより魔物に近い体に変えら\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:332"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:380",
   "ptr": "0x380",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "　れてしまった・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:332"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:39a",
   "ptr": "0x39a",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　人として寿命を全うする者もおれば、\\n",
   "en": "Some live out their days as men, while others are fated to become monsters before death takes them.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:3c3",
   "ptr": "0x3c3",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　死より先に魔物へと変じる運命の者も\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:39a"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:3ec",
   "ptr": "0x3ec",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "　おる。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:39a"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:3fa",
   "ptr": "0x3fa",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　だが、これは忘れんでおいて欲しい。\\n",
   "en": "But this I would have you remember. Even if we turn into monsters, our hearts remain human...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:423",
   "ptr": "0x423",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　たとえ魔物に変じようと、心は人の\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:3fa"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:44a",
   "ptr": "0x44a",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "　ままなのだということを・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:3fa"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:46e",
   "ptr": "0x46e",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "　我らは人間なのじゃ。\\n",
   "en": "We are human. We were merely born in the land where the Black Dragon dwells...",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:489",
   "ptr": "0x489",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　ただ、《黒竜》が棲みし地に生まれて\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　我らは人間なのじゃ。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:46e"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:4b2",
   "ptr": "0x4b2",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "　しまったというだけの・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:46e"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:4d4",
   "ptr": "0x4d4",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　おぬしたちの技と術、そして《黒の剣》\\n",
   "en": "Your skill and your arts, and the power of the Black Sword... Until now, I have quietly watched to see which way they would turn.",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:4ff",
   "ptr": "0x4ff",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "　の力・・・\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:4d4"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:510",
   "ptr": "0x510",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　それらが、どこへ向くのか、わしは今\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　の力・・・\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:4d4"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:539",
   "ptr": "0x539",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "　まで静観しておった。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:4d4"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:555",
   "ptr": "0x555",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　移民どもの傭兵として我らを討つか、\\n",
   "en": "Will you strike us down as the settlers' hired swords, or strike down the settlers as agents of our curse?",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:57e",
   "ptr": "0x57e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　あるいは、我が呪いの使徒として移民\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:555"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:5a7",
   "ptr": "0x5a7",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "　どもを討つか。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:555"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:5bd",
   "ptr": "0x5bd",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　あるいは、この地に秩序をもたらす\\n",
   "en": "Or will you strike down the Black Dragon, the root of the chaos, to bring order to this land...",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:5e4",
   "ptr": "0x5e4",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　ため、混沌の原因たる《黒竜》を\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:5bd"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:609",
   "ptr": "0x609",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "　討つか・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:5bd"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:61d",
   "ptr": "0x61d",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "　答えは自ら決めるがよい。\\n",
   "en": "Decide the answer for yourselves. I shall wait a while longer for that time to come.\"",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:63c",
   "ptr": "0x63c",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　わしは、今しばらく、その時を待って\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　答えは自ら決めるがよい。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:61d"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:665",
   "ptr": "0x665",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "　いようぞ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:61d"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:682",
   "ptr": "0x682",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "「《黒竜》は目覚め始めとる。\\n",
   "en": "\"The Black Dragon is beginning to wake. We may not have much time...\"",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:6a3",
   "ptr": "0x6a3",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　あまり時間は無いかもしれん・・・」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:682"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:6da",
   "ptr": "0x6da",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「村を出て、北へ進むと《貴族の塔》で\\n",
   "en": "\"Head north from the village and you'll reach the Nobles' Tower. It was once a holy site, where people went on pilgrimage......",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:703",
   "ptr": "0x703",
   "len": 8,
   "jp": "　す。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:6da"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:70e",
   "ptr": "0x70e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　かつては聖地として、人々の巡礼の地\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　す。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:6da"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:737",
   "ptr": "0x737",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "　だったのですが・・・・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:6da"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:759",
   "ptr": "0x759",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　貴族の軍隊が占領した時、数々のワナ\\n",
   "en": "But when the nobles' army took it, they turned it into a fortress full of traps and mazes.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:782",
   "ptr": "0x782",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　と迷路を張り巡らした要塞に改造され\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:759"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:7ab",
   "ptr": "0x7ab",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "　てしまいました。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:759"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:7c3",
   "ptr": "0x7c3",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　今は魔物だけが棲む廃きょですが、\\n",
   "en": "Now it's a ruin where only monsters live, but the traps they left are still working.",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:7ea",
   "ptr": "0x7ea",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　残されたワナは、まだ生きています。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:7c3"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:814",
   "ptr": "0x814",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　可能な限りの、最善の備えで臨まなけ\\n",
   "en": "Unless you go as well prepared as you possibly can, reaching the top will be hard.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:83d",
   "ptr": "0x83d",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　れば、塔を登りきることは難しいでし\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:814"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:866",
   "ptr": "0x866",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "　ょう」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:814"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:876",
   "ptr": "0x876",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "「以前、塔に登ったことのある魔導師が、\\n",
   "en": "\"A sorcerer who once climbed the tower told me something like this...",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:8a1",
   "ptr": "0x8a1",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　こんなことを話してました・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:876"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:8c7",
   "ptr": "0x8c7",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "　鬼門と裏鬼門は死。\\f",
   "en": "The Demon Gate and the Back Demon Gate mean death.",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:8e1",
   "ptr": "0x8e1",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "　・・・何のことでしょう？」\\f",
   "en": "...Whatever could that mean?\"",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:910",
   "ptr": "0x910",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「長老は温厚な方だから、恨み言はおっ\\n",
   "en": "\"The Elder's a gentle soul, so he never speaks a word of grudge, but I can't forgive those settlers!",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:939",
   "ptr": "0x939",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　しゃらないが、私は移民どもを許すこ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:910"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:962",
   "ptr": "0x962",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "　とができん！\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:910"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:976",
   "ptr": "0x976",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　奴らは我々の土地を奪い、街や聖地を\\n",
   "en": "They stole our land, destroyed our towns and holy sites, and slaughtered so many of our people.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:99f",
   "ptr": "0x99f",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　破壊し、多くの仲間を殺りくしたのだ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:976"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:9cb",
   "ptr": "0x9cb",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　そして、今でも『辺境のあいつら』と\\n",
   "en": "And even now they sneer at us as 'that frontier lot' and keep up the persecution!",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:9f4",
   "ptr": "0x9f4",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　蔑み、迫害の手を緩めていない！\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:9cb"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:a1a",
   "ptr": "0xa1a",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　本来なら、黒竜の封印を守るべき我ら\\n",
   "en": "They say some among us, who ought to guard the Black Dragon's seal, took to worshiping it and broke the First Seal, but......",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:a43",
   "ptr": "0xa43",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　の中から、黒竜を崇める者が現われ、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:a1a"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:a6c",
   "ptr": "0xa6c",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "　第一の封印を破壊したそうだ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:a1a"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:a8d",
   "ptr": "0xa8d",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "　が・・・・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　第一の封印を破壊したそうだ\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:a1a"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:aa3",
   "ptr": "0xaa3",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　私は、その彼らの気持ちがよく分かる。\\n",
   "en": "I understand just how they feel. ...It's a curse, you see. On the settlers.",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:ace",
   "ptr": "0xace",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　・・・つまりは、呪いさ。移民どもへ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:aa3"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:af7",
   "ptr": "0xaf7",
   "len": 8,
   "jp": "　の。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:aa3"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:b03",
   "ptr": "0xb03",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　爆薬を埋めこんで殺したのが何だって\\n",
   "en": "So what if they killed people with buried explosives?",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:b2c",
   "ptr": "0xb2c",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "　言うんだ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:b03"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:b3e",
   "ptr": "0xb3e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　そんなこと、始めに奴らが我々にやっ\\n",
   "en": "That's the very trick the settlers used on us first! That's how they took this land.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:b67",
   "ptr": "0xb67",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　た手口じゃないか。奴らは、そうやっ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:b3e"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:b90",
   "ptr": "0xb90",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "　てこの地を支配したんだ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:b3e"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:bb0",
   "ptr": "0xbb0",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　・・・我々、この地の民は、黒竜の\\n",
   "en": "...The Black Dragon made monsters of our bodies, we people of this land. But as we changed, we also gained powers we never expected, while still human.",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:bd7",
   "ptr": "0xbd7",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　せいで魔物のような体にさせられた。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:bb0"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:c00",
   "ptr": "0xc00",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　しかし、変化の過程で、人のまま\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:bb0"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:c25",
   "ptr": "0xc25",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "　思わぬ力も手に入れた。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:bb0"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:c43",
   "ptr": "0xc43",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "　それは、魔法の力であったり、\\n",
   "en": "Magic, or foresight, or shapeshifting, or invisibility... all sorts of powers...",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:c66",
   "ptr": "0xc66",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "　予知、変身、透明化など、様々\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:c43"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:c89",
   "ptr": "0xc89",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "　なものだが・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:c43"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:ca1",
   "ptr": "0xca1",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　我らがこうして、迫害から今も生き\\n",
   "en": "We owe our survival through the persecution, to this day, largely to those powers. And that's why...",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:cc8",
   "ptr": "0xcc8",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　延びていられるのは、その力に負う\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:ca1"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:cef",
   "ptr": "0xcef",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "　ところが大きい。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:ca1"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:d06",
   "ptr": "0xd06",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "　だからこそ・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　ところが大きい。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:ca1"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:d1e",
   "ptr": "0xd1e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　《黒竜》は、人をより高次の存在にす\\n",
   "en": "The Black Dragon raises people to a higher existence. ...That idea was born, and so some came to worship the Black Dragon as our Lord.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:d47",
   "ptr": "0xd47",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "　る者。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:d1e"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:d54",
   "ptr": "0xd54",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　・・・という考え方が生まれ、黒竜を\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　る者。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:d1e"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:d7d",
   "ptr": "0xd7d",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　御主と崇める者が現われるのだ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:d1e"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:da3",
   "ptr": "0xda3",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　そして、彼ら黒竜の使徒たちの目的は\\n",
   "en": "And those apostles of the Black Dragon have but one goal... ...to fulfill the curse. ...Heh heh heh...\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:dcc",
   "ptr": "0xdcc",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "　ひとつ・・・\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:da3"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:ddf",
   "ptr": "0xddf",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "　・・・呪いの成就さ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　ひとつ・・・\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:da3"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:df8",
   "ptr": "0xdf8",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "　・・・ククク・・・」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　・・・呪いの成就さ\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:da3"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:e16",
   "ptr": "0xe16",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「移民ども・・・特に、あの禍が禍がし\\n",
   "en": "\"The settlers... above all those vile nobles... will surely be swallowed by calamity. The day is near.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:e3f",
   "ptr": "0xe3f",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　い貴族どもは、必ずや、大いなる災い\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:e16"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:e68",
   "ptr": "0xe68",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "　に飲み込まれるだろう。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:e16"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:e85",
   "ptr": "0xe85",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "　・・・その日は近い」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　に飲み込まれるだろう。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 23SOH01B:e16"
  },
  {
   "id": "23SOH01B:ea7",
   "ptr": "0xea7",
   "len": 6,
   "jp": "長老\\n",
   "en": "Elder",
   "max": 6,
